sequenceDiagram
  actor M as Morgan
  participant UI as Web app
  participant PL as Plan service
  participant G as Governance
  participant OR as Run orchestrator
  participant V as Verifier
  participant AA as Architect agent
  participant SB as Sandbox
  participant LS as Lyzr Studio
  participant RT as Realtime hub
  participant RUN as App runtime
  Note over M,UI: 1 · Prompt
  M->>UI: Prompt + PDF
  Note over UI,PL: 2 · Write the plan
  UI->>PL: Write the plan (model gateway)
  PL-->>UI: Parts, checks and cost stream in
  Note over M,G: 3 · Review, click Build
  M->>UI: Build · ~N credits
  UI->>G: Budget and model policy
  G-->>OR: Allowed: start the run
  Note over OR,SB: 4 · Start the run
  OR->>SB: Resume or start the sandbox (warm pool)
  Note over OR,V: 5 · Checks first
  OR->>V: Write a check for each part
  V-->>OR: Checks locked
  loop 6–7 · Build and prove each part
    OR->>AA: Build the part
    AA->>SB: Edit files, run commands (daemon tools over MCP)
    AA->>G: Anything leaving the sandbox (push, key, new app)
    OR->>V: Run the part's check
    V-->>OR: Pass (Works) or fail (fix, up to 3)
    OR-->>RT: Part status
    RT-->>UI: Part turns Works (or Needs you)
  end
  Note over OR,LS: 8 · Agents into Lyzr Studio
  OR->>LS: Make each agent part in the workspace's Studio
  Note over M,UI: 9 · Fix a blocker
  M->>UI: Connect the app or add its key
  Note over UI,SB: 10 · Live preview throughout
  Note over M,RUN: 11 · Launch
  M->>UI: Go live (or share with the team first)
  UI->>G: Live needs an Admin? (governance on)
  G-->>OR: Approved
  OR->>RUN: Build the image, pre-publish checks, promote
  Note over RUN,LS: 12 · Run and watch
  RUN->>LS: App agents run on Studio
  RUN-->>M: Live URL
